      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1859_Start5" name="Business need to modify lease terms (space reduction/expansion, rent restructuring, use…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1859_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1859_Task6" name="COO identifies modification need: (a) space reduction: store underperforming…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: COO identifies modification need: (a) space reduction: store underperforming and excess space can be surrendered, (b) space expansion: adjacent space available for store expansion, (c) rent restructuring: temporary rent relief during economic downturn or pandemic, (d) use change: add warehouse space or click-and-collect area, (e) subleasing: surplus space to be subleased to complementary tenant
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1859_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1859_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1859_Task7" name="COO negotiates modification terms with landlord: (a) space reduction: pro-rata…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: COO negotiates modification terms with landlord: (a) space reduction: pro-rata rent reduction; target minimum 15–20% rent reduction for 20–30% space surrender, (b) space expansion: rent increase per current sqm rate; negotiate TI allowance for expansion area, (c) rent restructuring: temporary reduction with step-up schedule back to normal, (d) document all agreed changes in lease amendment
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1859_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1859_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1859_Task8" name="Legal Counsel drafts lease amendment: (a) specify modification effective date…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal Counsel drafts lease amendment: (a) specify modification effective date, (b) updated rent schedule and lease term (if changed), (c) updated space measurements (if space changed), (d) any new conditions or waived provisions, (e) both parties execute amendment; notarized per Philippine legal requirements
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1859_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1859_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1859_Task9" name="Finance updates lease records: (a) update lease schedule in system with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Finance updates lease records: (a) update lease schedule in system with modified terms, (b) recalculate PFRS 16 ROU asset and lease liability, (c) post any modification gain/loss, (d) update rent payment schedule
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per accounting cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1859_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1859_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1859_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1859_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1859_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-367 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Negotiation &amp; Administration (PA-42.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1859_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1859_Annotation11" targetRef="W1859_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
