    <bpmn:process id="W_W1861" name="W1861. Lease Portfolio Dashboard &amp; Exposure Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly reporting cycle; quarterly board review
Frequency: Monthly dashboard; quarterly deep-dive
Volume: ~205 active leases
Owner: FP&amp;A
Participants: FP&amp;A, COO, CFO, Lease Administrator
Source: workflow W1861 — Lease Portfolio Dashboard &amp; Exposure Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1861_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1861_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1861_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1861_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1861_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1861_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1861_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1861_Start3" name="Monthly reporting cycle; quarterly board review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1861_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1861_Task4" name="Monthly: FP&amp;A generates lease portfolio dashboard: (a) total annual rent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: FP&amp;A generates lease portfolio dashboard: (a) total annual rent obligation by entity and landlord, (b) rent as % of revenue by store (target: rent ≤ 8–12% of store revenue for big-box retail), (c) PFRS 16 lease liability total and trend, (d) lease expiry profile: leases expiring in next 12, 24, 36 months with renewal status, (e) rent escalation schedule: upcoming escalations by month and amount, (f) stores where rent exceeds 12% of revenue (flag for renegotiation or relocation evaluation), (g) geographic concentration: rent exposure by region and landlord
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1861_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1861_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1861_Task5" name="Quarterly: FP&amp;A and COO present portfolio analysis to CFO and COO: (a) rent vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quarterly: FP&amp;A and COO present portfolio analysis to CFO and COO: (a) rent vs. revenue trend by store cluster, (b) upcoming lease expirations and renewal strategy, (c) market rent comparison: are BuildRight leases at, above, or below market?, (d) landlord concentration risk: what % of total rent is owed to top 5 landlords?, (e) capital expenditure forecast: upcoming TI refresh needs, (f) recommendations: renegotiation targets, relocation candidates, closure candidates
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / COO
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1861_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1861_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1861_Task6" name="Annually: FP&amp;A prepares lease portfolio section for Board of Directors: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annually: FP&amp;A prepares lease portfolio section for Board of Directors: (a) total lease commitment (undiscounted), (b) PFRS 16 lease liability impact on balance sheet, (c) 5-year lease expenditure forecast, (d) new store expansion impact on lease commitments, (e) portfolio optimization opportunities
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1861_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1861_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1861_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1861_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1861_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-367 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Negotiation &amp; Administration (PA-42.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
